<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{!checked}}" class="card"><view class="loading-line">校验权限…</view></view>

  <view wx:elif="{{!allowed}}" class="card">
    <view class="banner banner-bad">{{accessError || '当前账号没有管理权限。请联系项目管理员。'}}</view>
    <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-block mt" bindtap="onRetryAccess">重新检查</button>
    <view class="small muted">这是独立运营工具，请使用获授权的开发者账号。普通小程序账号不会因打开此工具获得权限。</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="page-heading"><view class="page-title">果小哨运营</view><view class="page-subtitle">独立运营工具 · 操作连接真实云环境</view></view>
    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title"><text>运行统计</text><text class="sub">{{stats ? stats.serverTimeText : ''}}</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{stats}}" class="stat-row">
        <view class="stat"><view class="num">{{stats.users}}</view><view class="lbl">用户</view></view>
        <view class="stat"><view class="num">{{stats.activeFollows}}</view><view class="lbl">有效关注</view></view>
        <view class="stat"><view class="num">{{stats.events}}</view><view class="lbl">事件</view></view>
        <view class="stat"><view class="num">{{stats.queries}}</view><view class="lbl">查询</view></view>
      </view>
      <view class="btn-row wrap">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" bindtap="loadStats">刷新</button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm {{busy === 'seed' ? 'disabled' : ''}}" disabled="{{busy === 'seed'}}" bindtap="onSeedCatalog">重新导入目录</button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title"><text>提醒效果（近 7 天）</text><text class="sub">{{insights ? '自 ' + insights.sinceText : ''}}</text></view>
      <block wx:if="{{insights}}"><view wx:for="{{insights.lines}}" wx:key="*this" class="small">{{item}}</view></block>
      <view wx:else class="small muted">读取近 7 天的可取货时长、未发送原因、发送延迟和「买到了吗」回答。</view>
      <view class="btn-row wrap">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" disabled="{{busy === 'insights'}}" bindtap="onLoadInsights">{{busy === 'insights' ? '读取中…' : (insights ? '刷新' : '读取')}}</button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title"><text>真实付费与首付队列（近 30 天）</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!growth}}" class="small muted">按真实订单证据、首个有效目标和成熟观察期核对；仅按需读取，不影响用户查询。</view>
      <block wx:else><view wx:for="{{growth.lines}}" wx:key="*this" class="small">{{item}}</view></block>
      <view class="btn-row wrap"><button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" disabled="{{!!busy}}" bindtap="onLoadGrowth">{{busy === 'growth' ? '读取中…' : '读取增长报表'}}</button></view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title"><text>用户操作</text></view>
      <view class="input-row">
        <input class="input" value="{{grant.userKey}}" aria-label="目标用户标识" placeholder="userKey（appid:openid）" data-field="userKey" bindinput="onGrantInput" />
      </view>
      <view class="input-row">
        <input class="input" type="number" value="{{grant.days}}" aria-label="发放会员天数" placeholder="会员天数" data-field="days" bindinput="onGrantInput" />
        <input class="input" type="text" value="{{grant.amount}}" aria-label="调整次数，可输入负数" placeholder="次数（可负）" data-field="amount" bindinput="onGrantInput" />
      </view>
      <input class="input" value="{{grant.note}}" aria-label="发放备注，可选" placeholder="备注（可选）" data-field="note" bindinput="onGrantInput" />
      <view class="btn-row wrap">
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm {{busy === 'membership' ? 'disabled' : ''}}" disabled="{{busy === 'membership'}}" bindtap="onGrantMembership">发放会员</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm {{busy === 'credits' ? 'disabled' : ''}}" disabled="{{busy === 'credits'}}" bindtap="onGrantCredits">发放次数</button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm {{busy === 'lookup' ? 'disabled' : ''}}" disabled="{{busy === 'lookup'}}" bindtap="onLookup">查用户</button>
      </view>
      <block wx:if="{{lookup}}">
        <view class="row-between mt">
          <text class="small muted">查询结果</text>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" size="mini" aria-label="复制查询结果" bindtap="onCopyLookup">复制</button>
        </view>
        <scroll-view scroll-y class="json-box"><text class="mono tiny" user-select>{{lookupText}}</text></scroll-view>
      </block>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">
        <text>运行配置</text>
        <text class="sub">{{saving ? '保存中' : configLoading ? '读取中' : configDirty ? '已修改' : configLoaded ? '已读取' : '等待读取配置'}}</text>
      </view>
      <textarea class="config-editor mono" value="{{configText}}" maxlength="-1" aria-label="运行配置 JSON" disabled="{{saving || configLoading}}" bindinput="onConfigInput" auto-height></textarea>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" disabled="{{saving || configLoading}}" bindtap="onReloadConfig">{{configDirty ? '重载并替换草稿' : '重新加载'}}</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" disabled="{{saving || configLoading || !configLoaded || !configDirty}}" bindtap="onSaveConfig">保存配置</button>
      </view>
      <view class="tiny muted mt">月卡、年卡可手动查询日本、台湾、香港、美国。按 JP、TW、HK、US 设置的 internationalMarkets 控制其余账号的公众查询，internationalMonitoring 控制后台监测，internationalNotifications 控制微信提醒。保存后立即生效。</view>
      <view class="tiny muted mt">每站默认每分钟最多向苹果发起 6 次请求。使用默认配额开启自动监测时，每站手动查询最多使用其中 2 次。复用近期库存不会占用新的苹果请求额度。</view>
      <view class="tiny muted mt">签到固定每日 1 次，最多累计 10 次。可编辑：quota（仅 queryCost 和 historyCost） / memberProduct / memberPlans / memberRedemption / newProductWindows / notifications / collector / query / internationalQueryLimits / announcement / notices / features / growthExperiment。announcement 可设为 null 或含 text、kind、expiresAt 的对象。notices 为公告板列表，可设 title、startsAt、expiresAt，到期自动隐藏。两处均可填 titleEn、textEn，缺少译文时英文界面标注并显示原文。2.0 新入口与采集默认关闭；实验需先完成 A/A 核验，最多一个主链路实验。管理员名单仅由云端配置管理。</view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
